 "open": [
  "Session browser rows don't show avatars: that plugin (PR #195) isn't on main yet; once it lands, one `<AgentAvatar agent={run.agent} />` in its row does it.",
  "PR rows (push banner) and orchestrator step rows show no avatar of their own (the build row above them does).",
  "Agent identity for a plain build launch comes from the build's `Agent: <name>` line: the launcher tags runs with the build name, not the agent id (`AXF_AGENT`), so a build whose detail names nobody shows initials.",
  "The `avatar@1` asset type has no `source: \"agent\"` yet (the `agent-avatar` asset uses `text`); adding it is an asset-type contract change (Fable), not done here.",
  "Cost between meter updates is the last streamed figure (no interpolation); exact once the run's result arrives.",
  "Kotlin twin of the agent directory / AgentAvatar deferred (Android on hold)."
 ]
}
